  "contract": [
    "Earth, Wind, and Fire 706531 (Runic talent, passive): 'Striking at least 5 enemies with Runic Explosion now",
    "unleashes Wild Steam.' Its only effect is aura 42 SPELL_AURA_PROC_TRIGGER_SPELL naming 707458, a 1 sec,",
    "5-stack 'Dummy Stacker', and Spell.dbc gives it ProcFlags 0, so SpellMgr generates no proc entry and nothing ever",
    "happened. Wild Steam 803737: 'Stomp the ground in a 8 yd radius around you ... Frostfire Damage to nearby",
    "enemies' (TARGET_DEST_CASTER + TARGET_UNIT_DEST_AREA_ENEMY, radius 8). Runic Explosion 712324 is an 8 yd area",
    "around the Marked: Runic Brand (712323) target, cast when a Runeblade spends the mark. Expected: one Runic",
    "Explosion that strikes 5 enemies casts Wild Steam exactly once; one striking 4 enemies does not; without the",
    "talent nothing is cast. Fixtures: four enemies 3 yd and one 9 yd in front of the Runemaster. The mark is cast",
    "directly (the Brand's own trigger) and a Runeblade on the near enemy explodes on all five; a directly cast",
    "Runic Explosion 4 yd behind the Runemaster reaches only the four near enemies (7 yd vs 13 yd). Wild Steam's",
    "tooltip adds $AP*.25; with no spell_bonus_data row its damage had no attack-power term, so the native damage",
    "calculation must gain 0.25 per point of attack power (times the percent done modifiers, about 1)."
